IksNorTen of course they are not responsible for it, neither am I saying Pixel 7 not having MTE is why they should support Pixel 11. Please read my message again.

I am indeed asking them to accept a security regression due to the gap between the previous generations and the upcoming Motorola phones.

@Sonic my backup plan will be to continue using my Pixel 7 and find a new owner for the Pixel 11 indeed. However, I was hoping to upgrade due to a variety of reasons you can imagine come up with an old phone, without having to pay hundreds more euros to buy a previous generation (with weaker security in the Titan chip, might I add).
